    "body": "fix on issue/2316-data-dir-new-layout · PR #2318 · pinned by data_dir::tests::the_new_cargo_build_dir_layout_finds_the_repository_assets · merges when reviewed\n\nNotes:\n\n- The `corner_arc_radius` failure of the same run is a different defect. It fails on Windows too. It is tracked in #2317.\n- Observation, not verified: in `control_comp` and `wear_comp`, `posting::default_machine()` gave `Value::Null` because the machine file was not found. `engine::run` with that null machine then wrote a program with `(CAMCRAFT)` and no `M8`. It did not refuse. The comment in `posting.rs` says that \"the null machine refuses the post downstream\". A next worker should check that the real post path (`post_setup`, `post_script`) refuses a null default machine. The test failed at the golden compare before that call.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
